* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.exe binary

# evidence-forensics-byte-stability-01 (PR #73 review LOW-1; PR #69 gen-2 HIGH root):
# sha-recorded evidence must be checkout-invariant. Last match wins over * text=auto:
# no eol/encoding conversion either way, so checkout bytes == committed bytes and
# recorded sha256s verify on every platform. Enumerated classes (all under docs/evidence/**):
# capture sidecars, MANIFEST_sha256.txt manifests, DYAD request specs/responses,
# unblinding maps, raw consoles recording payload hashes, run records.
docs/evidence/** -text
